OL,3,GNEWSAHow a lake built for steel helps
OL,4,Afight drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FMuch of England has faced drought
OL,7,Fconditions during a summer marked by
OL,8,Frepeated heatwaves, but the North East
OL,9,Fhas been spared water scarcity despite
OL,10,Fexperiencing what the Environment
OL,11,FAgency dubs "prolonged dry weather".
OL,13,FOne of the, quite literally, biggest
OL,14,Freasons is that Northumberland is home
OL,15,Fto England's largest reservoir `
OL,16,FKielder Water.
OL,18,FSo how did the country's least
OL,19,Fpopulated region gain this huge asset
OL,20,Fand will the lake continue to protect
OL,21,Fthe North East from water shortages
OL,22,Flong into the future?
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
