OL,3,GNEWSAHow a lake built for steel helps
OL,4,Afight drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FKielder Water opened in 1982 and is the
OL,7,Fbiggest man-made lake in the UK,
OL,8,Fholding about 200bn litres of water.
